I recently got this one wrong by reading the wrong column
in the spoiler.

K-rations are indeed heavier the royal jelly.  Early in
the game that can make a big difference but toward the
end when your strength has been maxed out and you have a
blessed bag of holding weight matters less than the
number of points per bite.

My first reaction was that lembas wafers would be the
best food.  From weight to nutrition they are wonderfull.
When facing Famine they take 2 turns to eat and that extra
turn can be a disaster.  Much of the time it doesn't much
matter how many turns it takes to eat; just be in a
corner.  Other times it is very important that you use a
1-bite food, like when facing Famine.


